    "title": "Barefoot panhandler apprehended for third time after begging near The Villages - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carrie Gloeckner Rose ,\n15 hours ago A barefoot panhandler was apprehended for the third time while begging near The Villages. Alex Moulton, 24, of Summerfield, was apprehended Monday afternoon at the intersection of U.S. Hwy. 441 and SE Hwy. 42, near Mulberry Grove Plaza, according to an arrest report from the Marion County Sheriff’s Office. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
